content.text:
Now styles.css: replace the battle-unit block. The old block spans from `.battle-unit {` (line 1609) through `@keyframes hit-flash { ... }` (ending line 1789). I'll do it as one big edit — oldString from `.battle-unit {` down to the hit-flash closing brace. That's long; I have the exact content from the earlier read. Let me construct it carefully.

Old text (from read):
```
.battle-unit {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 5;
  top: calc(var(--y) * 1%);
  left: calc(var(--x) * 1%);
  display: flex;
  width: 62px;
  align-items: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 3px;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, filter 0.2s ease;
}

.battle-unit.hero {
  cursor: pointer;
}
... (through)
@keyframes hit-flash {
  0%, 100% { filter: none; }
  40% { filter: brightness(2.2) saturate(0.4); }
}
```

That's ~180 lines of oldString. Instead, do several smaller edits:

Edit A: `.battle-unit` core block + hero cursor.
Edit B: remove `.unit-portrait` block + `.unit-portrait .portrait` + `.battle-unit.hero.ready .unit-portrait` + both `.special-ring` rules → replace with `.unit-figure`/`.unit-sprite`/`.skill-aura` styles.
Edit C: `.battle-unit.enemy .unit-sprite` bubble + `.battle-unit.enemy .unit-sprite svg` → replace with enemy size tweak.
Edit D: boss block adjust.
Edit E: dead/hero.dead, enemy-die keyframes, lunge keyframes.

Let me do them sequentially.

input.newString:
.battle-unit {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 5;
  top: calc(var(--y) * 1%);
  left: calc(var(--x) * 1%);
  display: flex;
  width: 64px;
  align-items: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2px;
  transform: translate(-50%, -100%);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, filter 0.2s ease, transform 0.45s ease;
}

.battle-unit.hero {
  cursor: pointer;
}

.battle-unit .unit-name {
  max-width: 72px;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 0 3px;
  color: #dbcdb9;
  font-size: 6.5px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  line-height: 1;
  text-align: center;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.battle-unit.enemy .unit-name {
  color: #d7a694;
}

.unit-figure {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
}

.unit-sprite {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: clamp(40px, 12vw, 52px);
  filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45));
}

.unit-sprite svg {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

.unit-figure::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 0;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: -3px;
  width: 76%;
  height: 7px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52), transparent 68%);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.skill-aura {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 2;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: -6px;
  width: 96%;
  height: 14px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(244, 187, 85, 0.8), rgba(244, 187, 85, 0.24) 55%, transparent 74%);
  opacity: calc(0.08 + var(--p, 0) * 0.55);
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.battle-unit.hero.ready .skill-aura {
  opacity: 1;
  animation: aura-pulse 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes aura-pulse {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1); }
  50% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.2); }
}

.battle-unit.hero.ready .unit-sprite {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(244, 187, 85, 0.65)) drop-shadow(0 3px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45));
}

